<title>USA: Somanetics sets European marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Somanetics sets European marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somanetics Corp said Tuesday it had signed an agreement with  Medlink Europe to provide sales and market support for Somanetics's INVOS Cerebral Oximeter in Europe.</p>
<p>Medlink, which is based in Amsterdam and has offices in other parts of Europe, will also provide local distribution, customer service and technical and product service.</p>
<p>The INVOS oximeter, which was recently approved for sale by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, non-invasively monitors oxygen levels of the blood in a patient's brain.</p>
</text>
